okとpermissions断片の端末settingsへの冪等マージ、`lattice hooks status`による検証を契約候補とする。\n- Spotter併載時の二重提案は許容し、住み分け設計を行わない。\n- 正典契約は`docs/01_integration-package.md`へ置く。\n\n## Scope\n\n本ToDoの着手時に専用campaign planを起票し、その起票をもってbacklog側を完了する。dotagents側のonboardingとverify-install追従はdotagents側waveが所有し、本campaignの範囲外と明記する。\n\n## 受入条件\n\n専用planがLattice storeへ正規authoringされ、install/status契約、Claude/Codex host、冪等merge、permissions、非目標、検証工程がtask graphとして保持される。","lane":"campaign-entry","narrative_anchor":null,"narrative_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L100","parent_task_id":null,"task_id":"bk-006","title":"sensor気づかせ導線のinstall契約を専用campaignとして起票する"}],"topology_digest":"bd8db8f4b3368374d6d435755a2abdeba7572ef444778cd570af5b20547981fd"},"plan_key":"backlog","predecessor":{"journal_head_digest":"8f05695dfc33927eff4e2e830f2bfde39e5e7fee6f198be8d0792f0e5d5f5ebd","plan_digest":"51be6074f22ead3bb3eac4824f297c605c90b401f6e45bc59e08c6df85ad8584","plan_version":"rev-8c24f82653b0a7e5a7d76902"},"project_id":"lattice","reconciliation":{"predecessor_reconciliation_digest":"9a0a68b54d51ba3669f4d699e74804338d57b4efd7098722ab55a18e9abb24b2","reconciliation_digest":"90e55ec6f2fa003333f45f09dccc9b71c06e1a9037356e71f8923dfa63d97c22","source_inventory_digest":"a12443409cae7a20227272beb4ba3209c4baa507b851420c36ce328a3e10febc"},"revision_digest":"2d07ac9b1177872756904f5efd8bec0837dc88c23a19602c038ea170668c30ca","schema":"lattice.todo_revision.v1","source_inventory":{"active":[{"source_digest":"5dd794501014d1218d6416aa25620a13c48a756b84d04c0ae9e06e78df1d5d3a","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L95","task_id":"bk-001"},{"source_digest":"11945b3b69a19460421863e49bacf266350f76ecc99079f555d2fa0d3b70b689","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L96","task_id":"bk-002"},{"source_digest":"6447d53b047ab2b253917739589d03df2518f4c106af282b66d115a6127398ea","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L97","task_id":"bk-003"},{"source_digest":"d523311903812274531df32e9b31b155c70668ddee3b2c264105ebe2e23a3457","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L98","task_i